      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu atupristu, tiyenu chumichi; enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, tiyililenu; enu akwamutaŋa wamwanta, tenuku matu; muŋa kudenu kwekala kusompesha; muloŋa yenu mwadiŋi muhetu kuMizipa, niwanda wakuta haTabori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakutomboka anapundi mena akunama kulonda kujahana; hakwila ami yami mukwakuyihoshola wejima wawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi namwiluka, niIsarela hiyamujinda kudamuku. Ichi dinu eyi Efweremi, wunakoŋi dehi wuvumbi, Isarela wajilola dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yelaŋawu yinayikaŋeshi dehi kubalumuka cheŋi kudi Nzambi yawu, muloŋa mudi wena mudi spiritu yawuvumbi, hiyamwiluka Yehovaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanta wadinkayi Isarela wudi nakumushimuna wunsahu kumesu indi; dichi aIsarela naEfweremi akadimbuka mukuluwa kwawu; niYuda nawa wakadimbuka hamu nawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaya nanyikanka yawu yayimuna ninyikanka yawu yaŋombi, nawu tumukeŋakeŋi Yehova; hiyakamuwanaku. Yena wadifumisha dehi kudi wena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena anamukwatili dehi Yehova makasu; muloŋa wena anavwali dehi anyana akuvwela muyiputa. Ichi dinu kakweji kakaha kakayivwotela kumu namahawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbenu koleneti muGibeya, imbenu mpùŋa muRama; imbenu muBetaveni pu-u, munyima yeyeyi Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwifuku dakuyihoshola Efweremi wakabalumuka mahembi; mukachi kanyuza yaIsarela ami nayileji dehi yuma yakamwekana chalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba twawaYuda adi neyi antu atutujolaŋa ŋinza; nukwichila ndombu yami hadi wena neyi meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi anamukabishi, kukusompesha anamufwishi puchi, nanochu chatiyiliyi kuwaha nakwenda mwaya yuma yakuhemesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami kudi Efweremi nidi neyi kabubu kadyaloŋa yuma, kudi akwamutaŋa waYuda nidi neyi mbumbu wafulaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
