          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi namoni yikatu yindi, Yuda namoni chitu chindi; Efweremi hakuya kudi aAshuri, hakutemesha atuŋanda kudi mwanta Yarebi. Ilaŋa yena hanatweshi kuyukaku, hakayikuswisha chitu chenuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami kudi Efweremi nakekala neyi mutupa, hela kudi akwamutaŋa waYuda nakekala neyi mwenzi wamutupa. Ami, ami chi, nakatabula, hinukudiyila; nakasenda kwami, hikwakekala wakuyipulwishaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
